      "ambiguous single digit hour": 'Single-digit hour "{{hour}}" without leading zero - could mean {{hour}} (in the morning) or {{hour_pm}} (after midday). Add a leading zero like "0{{hour}}" or change it to "{{hour_pm}}" to be explicit.',
